{"doc_type":"deep_dive","title":"Transformer架构深度解析","slug":"transformer-architecture-deep-dive","summary":"从注意力机制到编码器、解码器，解释现代大模型的核心架构。","content":"Transformer使用自注意力机制建模序列中任意位置之间的关系。核心组件包括多头注意力、位置编码、前馈网络、残差连接和层归一化。训练阶段通常采用大规模并行计算，推理阶段则通过KV Cache减少重复计算。编码器适合理解任务，解码器适合生成任务，编码器解码器结构常用于翻译与摘要。","category":"模型架构","subcategory":"Transformer","tags":["Transformer","Attention","KV Cache","神经网络"],"technologies":["PyTorch","CUDA","FlashAttention"],"difficulty":"高级","language":"zh-CN","status":"published","featured":true,"open_source":true,"use_cases":["文本生成","机器翻译","语义理解"],"risks":["显存占用高","长上下文成本高"],"author":{"name":"林舟","type":"researcher"},"metrics":{"quality_score":9.5,"reading_minutes":18,"popularity":95,"token_estimate":4200},"model_profile":{"family":"Transformer","modalities":["text"],"parameters_billion":7.0,"context_window":32768},"published_at":"2026-02-10T10:30:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-21T14:00:00+08:00","source":{"name":"架构研究笔记","url":"https://example.com/transformer","verified":true},"metadata":{"version":"2.0","license":"CC-BY-4.0","region":"global"},"related_topics":["位置编码","注意力机制","大语言模型"]}
