{"doc_type":"tutorial","title":"Elasticsearch混合检索入门","slug":"elasticsearch-hybrid-search","summary":"结合关键词搜索和向量相似度提升AI知识检索效果。","content":"混合检索同时利用BM25的精确词项匹配和向量检索的语义召回能力。可以分别召回候选结果，再使用RRF融合排名；也可增加业务权重、时间衰减和重排模型。评测时应记录Recall@K、MRR、NDCG和答案命中率，并构建覆盖同义词、缩写和长问题的测试集。","category":"搜索技术","subcategory":"混合检索","tags":["Elasticsearch","BM25","向量搜索","RRF"],"technologies":["Elasticsearch 8","dense_vector","kNN","Reranker"],"difficulty":"中级","language":"zh-CN","status":"published","featured":false,"open_source":true,"use_cases":["语义搜索","商品搜索","知识检索"],"risks":["召回偏差","向量维度成本","排序不可解释"],"author":{"name":"搜索平台组","type":"team"},"metrics":{"quality_score":8.9,"reading_minutes":15,"popularity":90,"token_estimate":3300},"benchmark":{"recall_at_10":0.91,"mrr":0.84,"ndcg_at_10":0.88,"sample_size":1200},"published_at":"2026-04-02T13:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-29T09:00:00+08:00","source":{"name":"搜索实验室","url":"https://example.com/hybrid-search","verified":true},"metadata":{"version":"1.0","license":"Apache-2.0","region":"global"},"related_topics":["RAG","分词器","相关性调优"]}
