{"doc_type":"architecture","title":"AI智能体系统设计","slug":"ai-agent-system-design","summary":"介绍规划、工具调用、记忆和反馈组成的智能体闭环。","content":"智能体以大模型为推理核心，通过规划器拆解目标，调用搜索、数据库、代码执行等工具，并使用短期记忆和长期记忆保存上下文。可靠系统必须限制工具权限、校验参数、设置预算与超时、记录执行轨迹，并在高风险动作前要求人工确认。多智能体适合边界清晰且可并行的任务。","category":"智能体","subcategory":"系统架构","tags":["Agent","工具调用","记忆系统","任务规划"],"technologies":["Function Calling","Workflow Engine","Vector Store"],"difficulty":"高级","language":"zh-CN","status":"published","featured":true,"open_source":false,"use_cases":["自动化运维","研究助手","业务流程编排"],"risks":["越权操作","循环调用","成本失控","错误传播"],"author":{"name":"顾言","type":"architect"},"metrics":{"quality_score":9.4,"reading_minutes":20,"popularity":96,"token_estimate":4600},"agent_config":{"planning":"hierarchical","memory":["short_term","long_term"],"max_steps":12,"human_approval":true},"published_at":"2026-04-12T10:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-04T10:00:00+08:00","source":{"name":"智能体设计手册","url":"https://example.com/agent-design","verified":true},"metadata":{"version":"2.3","license":"CC-BY-NC-4.0","region":"global"},"related_topics":["工作流","上下文工程","AI安全"]}
