{"doc_type":"overview","title":"多模态大模型能力地图","slug":"multimodal-model-capability-map","summary":"梳理文本、图像、音频和视频统一理解与生成能力。","content":"多模态模型将不同媒介映射到共享表示空间，支持图像问答、文档理解、语音对话、视频摘要和跨模态生成。评估时不仅要衡量单一模态准确率，还要测试时序理解、视觉定位、文字识别、跨模态一致性以及复杂指令遵循。生产应用需关注媒体版权和生物识别隐私。","category":"多模态AI","subcategory":"能力概览","tags":["多模态","视觉语言模型","语音","视频理解"],"technologies":["Vision Encoder","Audio Encoder","Multimodal LLM"],"difficulty":"中级","language":"zh-CN","status":"published","featured":true,"open_source":true,"use_cases":["文档理解","视频摘要","语音助手","视觉问答"],"risks":["肖像权","版权风险","伪造内容"],"author":{"name":"多模态研究组","type":"team"},"metrics":{"quality_score":9.0,"reading_minutes":14,"popularity":93,"token_estimate":3100},"model_profile":{"family":"Vision-Language","modalities":["text","image","audio","video"],"parameters_billion":12.0,"context_window":65536},"published_at":"2026-04-20T15:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-25T12:00:00+08:00","source":{"name":"能力调研","url":"https://example.com/multimodal-map","verified":true},"metadata":{"version":"1.4","license":"CC-BY-4.0","region":"global"},"related_topics":["计算机视觉","语音识别","生成式视频"]}
