{"doc_type":"tutorial","title":"LoRA微调从数据到部署","slug":"lora-finetuning-pipeline","summary":"讲解低秩适配的训练数据、超参数、验证和模型合并。","content":"LoRA冻结基础模型参数，仅训练插入注意力层的低秩矩阵，可显著降低显存需求。项目应先清洗指令数据并划分训练、验证、测试集，再选择rank、alpha、dropout和目标层。训练后需要比较基础模型与微调模型在通用能力、领域能力和安全指标上的变化，避免灾难性遗忘。","category":"模型训练","subcategory":"参数高效微调","tags":["LoRA","Fine-tuning","PEFT","训练数据"],"technologies":["PyTorch","Transformers","PEFT","DeepSpeed"],"difficulty":"高级","language":"zh-CN","status":"published","featured":false,"open_source":true,"use_cases":["领域适配","风格定制","分类抽取"],"risks":["过拟合","灾难性遗忘","训练数据污染"],"author":{"name":"模型工程组","type":"team"},"metrics":{"quality_score":9.3,"reading_minutes":24,"popularity":92,"token_estimate":5600},"training_config":{"rank":16,"alpha":32,"dropout":0.05,"epochs":3,"learning_rate":0.0002,"samples":48000},"published_at":"2026-05-02T09:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-30T18:00:00+08:00","source":{"name":"训练实验记录","url":"https://example.com/lora-pipeline","verified":true},"metadata":{"version":"1.8","license":"Apache-2.0","region":"global"},"related_topics":["量化","指令微调","模型评测"]}
