{"doc_type":"benchmark","title":"大语言模型综合评测方案","slug":"llm-evaluation-framework","summary":"构建覆盖质量、安全、成本和延迟的多维评测体系。","content":"模型选型不能只看公开榜单。企业评测集应包含真实业务任务、边界案例和对抗样本，指标覆盖正确性、完整性、事实性、指令遵循、拒答、安全、延迟与成本。自动评审需要使用明确量表并定期与人工评审校准，所有评测都应固定模型版本、提示词和采样参数。","category":"模型评测","subcategory":"评测体系","tags":["Benchmark","LLM-as-a-Judge","事实性","成本评测"],"technologies":["Evaluation Harness","Tracing","Dataset Versioning"],"difficulty":"高级","language":"zh-CN","status":"published","featured":true,"open_source":true,"use_cases":["模型选型","版本回归","上线验收"],"risks":["评测泄漏","评审模型偏差","指标单一"],"author":{"name":"质量平台组","type":"team"},"metrics":{"quality_score":9.7,"reading_minutes":21,"popularity":94,"token_estimate":4900},"benchmark":{"accuracy":0.87,"faithfulness":0.91,"safety_pass_rate":0.98,"p95_latency_ms":1380,"sample_size":3000},"published_at":"2026-05-10T11:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-02T17:00:00+08:00","source":{"name":"模型评测规范","url":"https://example.com/llm-eval","verified":true},"metadata":{"version":"2.2","license":"CC-BY-4.0","region":"cn"},"related_topics":["红队测试","数据集","可观测性"]}
