{"doc_type":"security_guide","title":"生成式AI红队测试方法","slug":"generative-ai-red-teaming","summary":"覆盖越狱、提示词注入、数据泄露和危险工具调用的安全测试。","content":"红队测试应根据系统资产、攻击面和权限模型设计用例。常见测试包括直接与间接提示词注入、系统提示泄露、敏感数据提取、越权工具调用、编码混淆、多轮诱导和资源耗尽。测试环境要隔离真实生产权限，发现的问题需要记录复现步骤、影响等级、修复措施和回归结果。","category":"AI安全","subcategory":"红队测试","tags":["Red Team","越狱","提示词注入","安全评测"],"technologies":["Threat Modeling","Policy Engine","Audit Log"],"difficulty":"高级","language":"zh-CN","status":"published","featured":true,"open_source":false,"use_cases":["上线安全测试","智能体审计","模型验收"],"risks":["测试载荷扩散","误触真实系统","敏感样本泄露"],"author":{"name":"安全实验室","type":"team"},"metrics":{"quality_score":9.6,"reading_minutes":19,"popularity":89,"token_estimate":4400},"security":{"severity":"high","attack_vectors":["prompt_injection","jailbreak","data_exfiltration","tool_abuse"],"controls":["sandbox","allowlist","approval"]},"published_at":"2026-05-22T14:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-28T15:30:00+08:00","source":{"name":"安全测试手册","url":"https://example.com/ai-red-team","verified":true},"metadata":{"version":"2.0","license":"internal-demo","region":"global"},"related_topics":["威胁建模","最小权限","内容安全"]}
