{"doc_type":"research_note","title":"算法公平性与偏差检测","slug":"algorithmic-fairness-bias-detection","summary":"分析数据偏差、模型偏差和结果偏差的识别与缓解方法。","content":"偏差可能来自样本代表性不足、历史标签不公、代理变量、目标函数选择和部署环境变化。评估应按相关群体拆分准确率、召回率、误报率与校准度，并结合业务影响进行解释。缓解手段包括重采样、重加权、约束优化、阈值调整与人工复核，但技术指标不能替代社会和法律判断。","category":"负责任AI","subcategory":"公平性","tags":["Fairness","Bias","可解释性","群体评测"],"technologies":["Fairness Metrics","Model Card","Explainability"],"difficulty":"高级","language":"zh-CN","status":"published","featured":false,"open_source":true,"use_cases":["招聘模型","信贷评估","内容推荐"],"risks":["群体歧视","指标误用","代理变量泄露"],"author":{"name":"AI伦理研究组","type":"researcher"},"metrics":{"quality_score":9.0,"reading_minutes":17,"popularity":82,"token_estimate":3900},"fairness_metrics":{"demographic_parity_gap":0.04,"equal_opportunity_gap":0.03,"calibration_error":0.02,"groups_evaluated":6},"published_at":"2026-06-03T09:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-18T11:00:00+08:00","source":{"name":"公平性研究笔记","url":"https://example.com/ai-fairness","verified":true},"metadata":{"version":"1.1","license":"CC-BY-4.0","region":"global"},"related_topics":["AI伦理","模型卡","可解释AI"]}
