{"doc_type":"performance_guide","title":"大模型推理加速与成本优化","slug":"llm-inference-optimization","summary":"比较量化、批处理、缓存、投机解码和并行策略。","content":"推理优化需要在质量、延迟、吞吐和成本之间权衡。常见手段包括INT8或INT4量化、连续批处理、前缀缓存、KV Cache管理、投机解码、张量并行和流水线并行。优化前应使用真实请求分布建立基线，分别评估首Token延迟和每Token延迟，避免只提高吞吐却损害交互体验。","category":"模型部署","subcategory":"推理优化","tags":["Inference","Quantization","KV Cache","Batching"],"technologies":["vLLM","TensorRT-LLM","CUDA","ONNX Runtime"],"difficulty":"高级","language":"zh-CN","status":"published","featured":true,"open_source":true,"use_cases":["在线推理","私有化部署","成本优化"],"risks":["精度下降","延迟抖动","显存碎片"],"author":{"name":"推理引擎组","type":"team"},"metrics":{"quality_score":9.4,"reading_minutes":20,"popularity":94,"token_estimate":4700},"benchmark":{"throughput_tokens_per_second":1850.5,"p95_latency_ms":920,"gpu_utilization":0.86,"cost_reduction_percent":41.0,"sample_size":10000},"published_at":"2026-06-16T10:30:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-31T14:30:00+08:00","source":{"name":"性能实验报告","url":"https://example.com/inference-optimization","verified":true},"metadata":{"version":"2.1","license":"Apache-2.0","region":"global"},"related_topics":["模型量化","GPU调度","性能压测"]}
