{"doc_type":"landscape","title":"开源大模型生态观察","slug":"open-source-llm-landscape","summary":"梳理模型、数据、推理框架和社区协作的开源生态。","content":"开源大模型生态包括基础模型、指令模型、训练数据、评测集、推理框架和应用工具。选型时除了能力，还要审查许可证、商用限制、模型来源、社区活跃度、硬件要求和安全记录。企业应固定版本与哈希值，建立第三方组件清单，并持续跟踪漏洞和许可证变化。","category":"技术生态","subcategory":"开源模型","tags":["Open Source","LLM","许可证","供应链安全"],"technologies":["Hugging Face","vLLM","PyTorch","Model Hub"],"difficulty":"中级","language":"zh-CN","status":"published","featured":true,"open_source":true,"use_cases":["模型选型","私有部署","技术调研"],"risks":["许可证违规","供应链风险","模型来源不明"],"author":{"name":"开源办公室","type":"team"},"metrics":{"quality_score":9.0,"reading_minutes":14,"popularity":92,"token_estimate":3150},"ecosystem":{"models_reviewed":38,"frameworks_reviewed":12,"active_projects":31,"commercial_friendly":24},"published_at":"2026-07-15T10:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-02T13:00:00+08:00","source":{"name":"开源生态月报","url":"https://example.com/open-llm-landscape","verified":true},"metadata":{"version":"2026.07","license":"CC-BY-4.0","region":"global"},"related_topics":["模型部署","软件供应链","模型评测"]}
