{"doc_type":"research_note","title":"合成数据生成与质量控制","slug":"synthetic-data-quality-control","summary":"讨论合成训练数据的生成、过滤、去重与分布验证。","content":"合成数据可以补充稀缺样本、生成边界案例和保护部分隐私，但也可能放大模型偏差或造成模式坍缩。生产流程应明确数据目标，混合多种生成策略，执行事实核验、规则过滤、语义去重和人工抽样，并比较真实数据与合成数据的分布。训练后必须在独立真实测试集上验证。","category":"数据工程","subcategory":"合成数据","tags":["Synthetic Data","数据增强","去重","质量评估"],"technologies":["LLM","Data Pipeline","Embedding","Deduplication"],"difficulty":"高级","language":"zh-CN","status":"published","featured":false,"open_source":true,"use_cases":["稀缺样本增强","隐私保护","对抗测试"],"risks":["偏差放大","事实错误","分布失真"],"author":{"name":"数据实验室","type":"team"},"metrics":{"quality_score":9.1,"reading_minutes":16,"popularity":86,"token_estimate":3650},"dataset":{"total_samples":120000,"synthetic_ratio":0.35,"duplicate_rate":0.008,"human_audit_samples":2400,"quality_pass_rate":0.93},"published_at":"2026-07-18T09:30:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-31T11:00:00+08:00","source":{"name":"数据质量实验","url":"https://example.com/synthetic-data","verified":true},"metadata":{"version":"1.3","license":"CC-BY-4.0","region":"global"},"related_topics":["训练数据","隐私计算","模型偏差"]}
