{"doc_type":"architecture","title":"知识图谱与大模型协同","slug":"knowledge-graph-llm-integration","summary":"通过实体关系、图检索和大模型增强复杂知识推理。","content":"知识图谱提供结构化实体、关系和约束，大模型擅长自然语言理解与生成。二者结合可先进行实体链接，再执行图查询或子图检索，最后由模型基于证据生成答案。系统需要处理实体消歧、关系时效性、图谱权限和多跳路径解释，避免让语言模型虚构关系。","category":"知识工程","subcategory":"知识图谱","tags":["Knowledge Graph","GraphRAG","实体链接","多跳推理"],"technologies":["Neo4j","Cypher","LLM","Elasticsearch"],"difficulty":"高级","language":"zh-CN","status":"published","featured":true,"open_source":true,"use_cases":["关系问答","风险关联","专家知识管理"],"risks":["错误实体链接","关系过期","图谱越权"],"author":{"name":"知识智能组","type":"team"},"metrics":{"quality_score":9.3,"reading_minutes":18,"popularity":89,"token_estimate":4100},"graph":{"entities":2400000,"relations":7800000,"entity_types":46,"relation_types":92,"update_mode":"incremental"},"published_at":"2026-07-20T14:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-01T10:30:00+08:00","source":{"name":"知识工程方案","url":"https://example.com/graph-llm","verified":true},"metadata":{"version":"2.4","license":"Apache-2.0","region":"global"},"related_topics":["RAG","实体识别","图数据库"]}
