{"doc_type":"overview","title":"语音AI技术链路","slug":"speech-ai-technology-stack","summary":"介绍语音识别、说话人识别、语音合成和实时对话。","content":"语音AI链路包括回声消除、降噪、语音活动检测、自动语音识别、语义理解、对话管理和语音合成。实时对话还要处理打断、端点检测、口音和网络抖动。涉及声纹时必须获得明确授权，并防范录音重放与合成语音攻击。","category":"语音智能","subcategory":"语音交互","tags":["ASR","TTS","Voice Activity Detection","实时对话"],"technologies":["Speech Encoder","Streaming ASR","Neural TTS"],"difficulty":"中级","language":"zh-CN","status":"published","featured":false,"open_source":true,"use_cases":["会议转写","语音助手","呼叫中心"],"risks":["声纹隐私","语音伪造","口音偏差"],"author":{"name":"语音技术组","type":"team"},"metrics":{"quality_score":8.9,"reading_minutes":13,"popularity":87,"token_estimate":2950},"benchmark":{"word_error_rate":0.061,"p95_latency_ms":310,"realtime_factor":0.18,"sample_size":8000},"published_at":"2026-07-22T10:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-30T15:00:00+08:00","source":{"name":"语音技术综述","url":"https://example.com/speech-ai","verified":true},"metadata":{"version":"1.5","license":"CC-BY-4.0","region":"cn"},"related_topics":["多模态AI","数字人","隐私保护"]}
