{"doc_type":"architecture","title":"现代推荐系统架构","slug":"modern-recommendation-system","summary":"结合召回、排序、重排和生成式推荐构建个性化体验。","content":"推荐系统通常由多路召回、粗排、精排和重排组成，并通过特征平台与实时流处理更新用户状态。大模型可用于内容理解、冷启动标签、对话式推荐和推荐理由生成，但不能替代核心反馈闭环。系统需要控制信息茧房、热门偏置、未成年人内容和反馈操纵。","category":"推荐系统","subcategory":"系统架构","tags":["Recommendation","召回排序","个性化","生成式推荐"],"technologies":["Two-Tower","Learning to Rank","Feature Store","LLM"],"difficulty":"高级","language":"zh-CN","status":"published","featured":true,"open_source":false,"use_cases":["内容推荐","商品推荐","对话式导购"],"risks":["信息茧房","热门偏置","反馈操纵"],"author":{"name":"推荐平台组","type":"team"},"metrics":{"quality_score":9.2,"reading_minutes":17,"popularity":90,"token_estimate":3850},"service_metrics":{"availability":0.9999,"p50_latency_ms":42,"p95_latency_ms":95,"error_rate":0.0008,"tokens_per_second":0.0},"published_at":"2026-07-26T11:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-02T09:00:00+08:00","source":{"name":"推荐架构手册","url":"https://example.com/recommendation","verified":true},"metadata":{"version":"2.8","license":"proprietary-demo","region":"global"},"related_topics":["用户画像","实时计算","内容安全"]}
