{"doc_type":"policy","title":"企业AI治理框架","slug":"enterprise-ai-governance-framework","summary":"建立AI项目分级、责任、审批、监控和退出机制。","content":"企业AI治理应覆盖需求立项、数据使用、模型选型、风险分级、上线审批、持续监控和退役。高风险系统需明确业务负责人、技术负责人和合规负责人，保存模型卡、数据说明、评测报告、变更记录与事故响应方案。治理目标是让创新在可识别、可审计和可追责的边界内进行。","category":"AI治理","subcategory":"治理体系","tags":["Governance","模型卡","风险分级","审计"],"technologies":["Model Registry","Policy Engine","Audit Platform"],"difficulty":"高级","language":"zh-CN","status":"published","featured":true,"open_source":true,"use_cases":["项目审批","风险管理","合规审计"],"risks":["责任不清","影子AI","治理形式化"],"author":{"name":"AI治理委员会","type":"committee"},"metrics":{"quality_score":9.6,"reading_minutes":20,"popularity":92,"token_estimate":4550},"governance":{"risk_levels":["low","medium","high","critical"],"review_cycle_days":90,"incident_sla_hours":4,"model_card_required":true},"published_at":"2026-07-29T10:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-04T09:00:00+08:00","source":{"name":"企业治理规范","url":"https://example.com/ai-governance","verified":true},"metadata":{"version":"3.0","license":"CC-BY-4.0","region":"cn"},"related_topics":["负责任AI","数据治理","安全评测"]}
